# Risk tiers: <glob> <low|medium|high>. Unmatched files are medium; a change takes its highest file tier.
# Tiers only go up: when a file matches several lines, the highest tier wins.

specs/* low
docs/* low
*.md low

# Examples of riskier surfaces; adjust to this repository.
# src/auth/* high
# src/payments/* high
# migrations/* high
# .github/workflows/* high
# .claude/* high
# CLAUDE.md medium
# Ranking .claude/ or CLAUDE.md above low moves retro changes to them out of the cleanup PR, into a kai-retro-<date> PR.
